{"duration_api_ms":77707,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"fe08b7a9-1ae4-407c-9b2f-5cde8dd43ba0","total_cost_usd":0.5691411999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":20,"cache_creation_input_tokens":36852,"cache_read_input_tokens":565526,"output_tokens":8057,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":701},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":36852,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1141,"cache_read_input_tokens":68740,"cache_creation_input_tokens":450,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":450},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":20,"outputTokens":8057,"cacheReadInputTokens":565526,"cacheCreationInputTokens":36852,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5691411999999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":701,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":36852,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":10,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I've mapped the `open-docx-real` journey (round 3) end to end and committed it as 93bc1c6. The p50 is **4,974 ms** (`total_ms=4974 min_ms=3710 max_ms=5121 runs=5`), and the document laid out as 11 pages in every run. All four acceptance commands pass, `theseus validate` reports 0 errors, and `theseus scope-check` is clean.\n\n**What I did**\n- `serve-integrated.sh` already existed, so I used it as is. It built and overlaid the sdkjs word bundle from the fork's `theseus` branch (0f61ccce).\n- I added `.theseus/oracle/journeys/open-docx-real.sh` and `open-docx-real-run.cjs`. They are copies of the 10-page runner with only the sample path and a longer timeout changed, so the marks and the \"fully rendered\" condition are the same.\n- I wrote `.theseus/journeys/open-docx-real.md`. It has the required header, a table of the timing marks, and the yaml block with 12 stages. The stages add up to exactly 4,974 ms, with `unattributed_ms: 0`.\n\n**Where the time goes, by module:**\n\n| module | ms | share |\n|---|---|---|\n| project (example service page, Editor.bin download, browser) | 1,684 | 33.9 % |\n| web-apps-documenteditor | 1,459 | 29.3 % |\n| sdkjs-word | 958 | 19.3 % |\n| x2t (p50 394 ms, from the converter log) | 394 | 7.9 % |\n| sdkjs-common | 273 | 5.5 % |\n| docservice | 206 | 4.1 % |\n\n**Decisions and caveats**\n- **The client-side split is an estimate.** The 1,164 ms from receiving Editor.bin to \"load complete\" is divided between modules using the CPU shares from the earlier PKT-0043 profile, which was of the text-only sample. This document has images and CJK fonts, so the font and image share (sdkjs-common) is probably understated. The map says this and lists profiling this window as the first follow-up. I didn't create a spawn request for it.\n- **The x2t stage is not fully the integrated build.** As PKT-0131 found, x2t still loads the packaged `sdk-all.bin`. This is noted in the map.\n- **The machine was quiet** (load 0.8 before the runs, 3.3 after); the previous round ran at about 6.\n\n**Comparison with the earlier map**\nThere was no earlier `open-docx-real` map, so I compared against `open-docx-10p` (round 3, 8,340 ms on a loaded machine). The absolute times aren't comparable because of the load difference, but the shares are. For this real document, x2t's share is about twice as large (7.9 % vs 3.6 %) and so is the Editor.bin download's (9.3 % vs 4.3 %). Word layout and paint stays near 20 %.\n\nI filled in the Executor log and appended the friction line. My first friction line used the wrong format and made `validate` fail; I replaced it with the per-question format.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas**\n- The cost that a real document adds over a text-only one falls mainly on x2t and the Editor.bin transfer.\n- The example service's editor page is a large stage (910 ms) that varies a lot from run to run (145 to 1,371 ms). That time belongs to the test harness, not to Euro-Office.","ttft_ms":3253,"type":"result","duration_ms":181202,"uuid":"7c69926a-d95a-4204-8342-5ff900540658","ttft_stream_ms":1905,"time_to_request_ms":389,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":11,"system_prompt":260,"resume_other":1,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":15,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":6,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":7,"init_frame_send":2,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":17,"query_setup":6,"auto_mode_context_wait":12,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":23,"message_normalization":4,"client_creation":3,"request_build":8},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":134,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":162,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":210,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":138,"process_rss_mib_result":229,"process_anon_mib_result":139,"process_peak_rss_mib":242,"process_cpu_ms_turn":3353,"process_wall_ms_turn":181201,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":1168,"process_wall_ms_streaming":55573,"main_stream_count":10,"main_stream_event_count":1174,"main_stream_chunk_count":907,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":1168,"wall_ms":55573,"entries":10},"tool":{"cpu_ms":1318,"wall_ms":102990,"entries":9},"first_event_wait":{"cpu_ms":518,"wall_ms":22077,"en